    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" para="true">APPENDICULA PRACTICA</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="2" para="true">De Cœna Domini.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">A. Quorsum instituit Christus Sacramen-</l>
    <l n="4">tum Eucharistiæ, quod &amp; Cœna</l>
    <l n="5">Domini appellatur? *1 Cor. 10.16.</l>
    <l n="6">1 Cor 11 20. * εὐλογίας. idem</l>
    <l n="7">quod εὐχαριστίας. confer. Mat. 26. cum Luc. 22.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">B. In gratam sui commemorationem, utque</l>
    <l n="9">mortem ejus percipientes annuntient. 1 Cor.</l>
    <l n="10">11,24,25, v. 26.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">A. Qualis autem ea debet esse Commemoratio?</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">B. Non tantum historica, in summis aut la-</l>
    <l n="13">bris aut cerebo fluida (quæ Hypocritarum &amp;</l>
    <l n="14">maxime Impiorum esse potest) sed practica &amp;</l>
    <l n="15">affectuosa, quæ vim quandam salutarem animæ</l>
    <l n="16">fideli altè imprimit, ac infigit. Psal. 78, 35,</l>
    <l n="17">36. Psal. 103, 18. Mat. 26.75. Psal. 147,7.</l>
    <l n="18">Isa. 26,8,9.</l>
    <l n="19" para="true">A. Id explica uberius.</l>
    <l n="20" para="true">B. Talis esse debet Christi in Cœna sua Re-</l>
